# 🔄 DATA TRANSFORMATION

Several transformations were performed to make the data suitable for analysis.

<table>

<tr>
<th>🔄 Transformation</th>
<th>🎯 Purpose</th>
</tr>

<tr>
<td>📅 Datetime Transformation</td>
<td>Extract hour, day and month</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td>🏷️ Label Encoding</td>
<td>Convert gender categories into numerical values</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td>🔢 One-Hot Encoding</td>
<td>Convert payment mode and zone categories</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td>📊 Binning</td>
<td>Create Low, Medium and High ride-frequency levels</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td>📈 Log Transformation</td>
<td>Reduce skewness in fare and distance</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td>√ Square Root Transformation</td>
<td>Reduce the effect of extreme duration values</td>
</tr>

</table>

